    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Bege sceadwisan ge refan . SE SCADwis gerefa sceal ægðær witan ge hlafordes land riht ge folces gerihtu be ðam ðe hit of ealddagum . witan geræddan 7 ælcre tilðan timan ðe to tune belimpð .</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the wise reeve. The wise reeve must know both the lord’s land law and the rights of the people as wise men counselled in days of old, and the season in which each task is due on the estate,</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[1] Se scadwis gerefa sceal ægðær witan ge hlafordes landriht ge folces gerihtu, be ðam ðe hit of ealddagum witan geraeddan, 7 ælcre tilðan timan, ðe to tune belimpð;</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
